Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.65,0:00:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU, YAMU, YAMU,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.91,0:00:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU, YAMU,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.27,0:00:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.23,0:00:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.47,0:00:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Your moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.91,0:01:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me seconds of that cheese.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.61,0:01:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and the ham.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.05,0:01:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And that weird jelly cake-looking thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.61,0:01:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,If this was a dual munchers\Ncompetition, you two would win.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.37,0:01:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,On behalf of Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.61,0:01:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Maximilian Pegasus,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.79,0:01:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to congratulate the\Nfour finalists and welcome
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.67,0:01:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,them to this final phase of the\NDuelist Kingdom competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.09,0:01:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I trust you all have your\Nplayoff entry cards. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.21,0:01:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,In your invitation to the Duelist\NKingdom, you received these two cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.25,0:01:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Glory of the King's Hand and\NGlory of the King's Opposite Hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.61,0:01:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You must have one of these to\Nparticipate in the final tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.93,0:01:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Those without them are disqualified.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.13,0:01:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's what they're for.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.75,0:01:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Each card provides unique prizes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.93,0:01:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The Glory of the King's Hand card is\Nneeded to claim the $3 million cash prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.05,0:01:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,The Opposite Hand card allows the winner\Nto challenge Pegasus for the championship.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.23,0:01:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Now he tells me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.57,0:01:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have either one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.49,0:02:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Of the millions of cards I own, I\Nrun across the two that I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.87,0:02:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to get me one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.65,0:02:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,To make tomorrow's tournament interesting,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.75,0:02:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,your host has added a special\Ningredient to your soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.73,0:02:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's staring at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.61,0:02:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, mine's eyeball free.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.89,0:02:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, this is worse than\Nhaving a fly in my soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.15,0:02:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Open up the eye and look\Ninside it, if you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.61,0:02:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Each of you has been\Nrandomly assigned a letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.33,0:02:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what's this for?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.71,0:02:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.65,0:02:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.35,0:02:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And now the island's\Ncomputer will pair up the
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.87,0:02:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,letters to determine\Ntomorrow's duel match-ups.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.75,0:02:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Gee, I wonder who's going\Nto have to face who.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.71,0:02:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.62,0:02:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I know who I'm dueling,\NI can use tonight to prepare.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.65,0:02:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter who I'm up against if\NI don't have one of them glory cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.79,0:02:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And tomorrow's duels are as follows.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.73,0:02:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,A versus B, C versus D.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.25,0:02:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Who has C?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.23,0:03:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Me, runt.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.37,0:03:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, it's payback for\Ntrapping us in that cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.51,0:03:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I crush you, you wish\Nyou were still in that cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.41,0:03:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like it's you and me, Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.51,0:03:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.93,0:03:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, me too, and may\Nthe best duelist win.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.03,0:03:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The duels are set.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.33,0:03:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi Moto versus Mai Valentine, and\NBandit Keith versus Joey Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.59,0:03:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Please enjoy the rest of this feast,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.49,0:03:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,because for three of you tomorrow,\NYour long journey will end in failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.69,0:03:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So it has begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.59,0:03:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm stuffed like a sumo wrestler.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.13,0:03:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that was good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.19,0:03:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you drank\Nthe entire eyeball soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.27,0:03:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey there, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.97,0:03:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.88,0:03:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We better get to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.79,0:03:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll need our rest if we're all going to
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.95,0:03:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,be in top shape for the\Ntournament tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.87,0:04:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, what's the point?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.39,0:04:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Since I don't have that card, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.67,0:04:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, this Glory of King's\Nhand card is yours, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.63,0:04:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you just think of it\Nas an early birthday present?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.25,0:04:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.25,0:04:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But Yuge, you need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.53,0:04:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The rules never said we needed both cards\Nto compete, so we each only need one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.33,0:04:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.24,0:04:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,If you give up now, who's\Ngoing to save your sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.35,0:04:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of big brother would you be if\Nyou didn't even try to win the prize money?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.65,0:04:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.75,0:04:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And besides, Joey, think about the odds.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.57,0:04:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,If we're both in the tournament, it doubles\Nour chances of winning the entire thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.69,0:04:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,So take it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.29,0:04:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.99,0:04:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.31,0:04:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a real pal, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.39,0:04:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,All this lovey-dovey stuff\Nis making my skin crawl.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.95,0:04:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So good night, boys and girls,\Nand catch you tomorrow, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.19,0:04:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Good night, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.89,0:04:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow's a big day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.17,0:04:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.08,0:04:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.87,0:05:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Night, guys. Yugi. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.45,0:05:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, thanks again for bailing me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.89,0:05:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the best, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.49,0:05:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, time to catch some Zs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.69,0:05:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't snore too loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.19,0:05:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't snore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.27,0:05:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You kept us up half the night\Nat the campfire, right, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.99,0:05:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.61,0:05:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Grandpa, I've made it this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.35,0:05:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,A couple of more victories\Nand we'll go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.81,0:05:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Together.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.31,0:05:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll have to fine-tune\Nmy deck if I'm to beat Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.75,0:05:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if it takes me all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.09,0:05:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Bavarian cream hit this spot right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.43,0:05:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Glazes and crawlers and...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.69,0:05:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Gigantic donut!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.01,0:05:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The one night I get to sleep in\Na decent bed and I'm wide awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.47,0:05:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.35,0:05:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what's up, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.29,0:05:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Trouble, Thea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.35,0:06:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan thinks that Pegasus\Ncheats in all his duels.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.15,0:06:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, he does.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.51,0:06:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.97,0:06:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You really think he beat Kaiba\Nthis morning by cheating?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.97,0:06:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.45,0:06:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba's one of the world's top duelists.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.45,0:06:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,but Pegasus beat him\Nlike he was an amateur.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.81,0:06:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.37,0:06:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can beat Kaiba that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.75,0:06:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,At least not playing fair and square.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.01,0:06:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The way he was dueling,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.25,0:06:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,it seemed like he knew what cards\Nwere in Kaiba's hand the entire time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.67,0:06:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.23,0:06:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus is as bogus as a $3 bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.87,0:06:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a punk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.99,0:06:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't trust that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.53,0:06:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you're right about\NPegasus, what can we do, Tristan?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.17,0:06:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Plenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.08,0:06:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll find out how Pegasus cheated.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.97,0:06:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,There has to be some clue\Ndown at the dueling platform.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.11,0:06:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll expose Pegasus for\Nthe fraud that he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.85,0:06:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,With all the gods everywhere,\Nwe'll need help from Yuge and Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.87,0:06:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,No, they have to rest for the tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.01,0:06:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And besides, a herd of\Nelephants won't wake Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.45,0:06:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's up to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.61,0:06:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to do this all by\Nourselves. I'm with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.23,0:07:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa, is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.95,0:07:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, I must speak with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.85,0:07:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.63,0:07:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow my voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.91,0:07:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep searching, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.75,0:07:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,There has to be a hidden\Ncamera or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.07,0:07:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe Pegasus isn't a cheater.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.01,0:07:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He could be good at guessing\Ncards like a psychic or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.83,0:07:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I once spoke to a psychic.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.29,0:07:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The lady said I'll have a nice\Ngirlfriend within six months.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.09,0:07:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a year, not a single date.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.73,0:07:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe in psychic powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.53,0:07:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.91,0:07:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Taya? Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.15,0:07:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan, you're back!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.85,0:07:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Something on my back?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.33,0:07:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.71,0:08:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.25,0:08:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,How can Moonlight enter this room?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.09,0:08:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.00,0:08:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,go stand on the dueling\Nplatform and pretend
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.49,0:08:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,to hold a card up just\Nlike you're dueling.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.97,0:08:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.35,0:08:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.89,0:08:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a tower right\Nacross the courtyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.55,0:08:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And isn't it convenient that the\Nwindow faces in this exact direction?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.63,0:08:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd be a piece of cake for\None of Pegasus' goons to hide
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.95,0:08:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,in the tower with a telescope\Nand spy on Kaiba's hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.07,0:08:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Then the goon relays Kaiba's cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.43,0:08:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus could be hiding a\Nreceiver under his hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.91,0:08:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Good thinking, Sherlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.43,0:08:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,There's bound to be tons of\Nproof hidden in that tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.17,0:08:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get over there right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.05,0:08:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What about the gods?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.65,0:08:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be safe with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.83,0:08:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.74,0:08:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yogi, beware of Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.95,0:09:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You must stop him or he could\Ndestroy the entire world. Pegasus?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.71,0:09:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming, Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.09,0:09:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, this castle's like a maze.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.43,0:09:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Shh, keep it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.55,0:09:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,There's goons around that corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.83,0:09:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,There's goons around every corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.19,0:09:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I said, shh, this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.89,0:09:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We're running around in circles.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.93,0:09:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be daytime before\Nwe get to the tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.03,0:09:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look at what I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.19,0:09:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that for?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.71,0:09:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,This grappling hook gives me a great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.39,0:09:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Harpy Lady combined with Cyber Shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.71,0:09:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi's already familiar with this\Ncombo because he saw my duel with Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.49,0:09:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,He knows my deck almost as well as I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.27,0:09:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'm to beat him, I can't rely\Non my same old bag of tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.05,0:09:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, time to snatch me\None of those special cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.07,0:10:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.98,0:10:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.97,0:10:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't find you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.95,0:10:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.86,0:10:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Beware of Pegasus!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.19,0:10:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus wields shadow powers\Nof incredible strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.61,0:10:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,much stronger than anyone\Ncould have imagined!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.89,0:10:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.80,0:10:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,How is that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.89,0:10:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe your plan is to enter\Nthe tower from the outside. Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.25,0:10:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanted to avoid all the guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.39,0:10:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't see goons up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.99,0:10:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa, tell me how can Pegasus'\Nshadow magic still be growing in power?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.45,0:10:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Every soul he traps in the shadow\Nrealm increases his strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.01,0:10:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.92,0:10:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got to be stopped!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.93,0:11:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Kaiba! Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.35,0:11:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.26,0:11:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,This is wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.51,0:11:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,This is terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.61,0:11:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Save me, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.65,0:11:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Save me, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.43,0:11:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Taya, take the\Nlead and we'll follow you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.23,0:11:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That way, in case you lose your grip\Nand fall off, one of us can catch you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.51,0:11:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You're next, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.19,0:11:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,He wants you, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.11,0:11:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is Pegasus after me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.15,0:11:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus unlocked tremendous magic\Nwith his single Millennium Item.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.93,0:11:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,How much power do you think he\Nwill wield if he has your puzzle?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.55,0:11:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan, that's not the\Nrope, that's my leg Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.57,0:11:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,climb faster Grandpa,\Nhow can I stop Pegasus?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.79,0:12:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as Pegasus learned to harness\Nthe magic of his Millennium Eye
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.19,0:12:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You must also learn to control the\Npower of your own Millennium Item
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.95,0:12:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,My puzzle?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.17,0:12:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Yugi, your Millennium\NPuzzle. But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.91,0:12:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That you must discover on\Nyour own Whatever it takes,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.05,0:12:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus must be defeated. If he wins,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.13,0:12:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,with his unlimited shadow powers\NAnd the magic of the Millennium
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.57,0:12:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Items? He can unleash Armageddon\Nupon the entire world! Hulk! Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.31,0:12:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do this, Yogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.15,0:12:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.81,0:12:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.65,0:12:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Your plans are horrible I got you\Nup here safe and sound, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.79,0:12:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.75,0:12:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even a telescope.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.21,0:12:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,How can that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.53,0:12:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Who do you suppose this is?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.05,0:13:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.03,0:13:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.07,0:13:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a mighty big painting.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.75,0:13:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you find a light switch?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.71,0:13:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.35,0:13:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you turn on the\Nlights? No. Then who did?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.65,0:13:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe the light's voice activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.27,0:13:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I've seen this portrait before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.25,0:13:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,In the dining hall, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.91,0:13:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,She must be very important to Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.73,0:13:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,But I haven't seen her at all\Nsince we've been in the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.15,0:13:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think maybe she's Pegasus' wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.51,0:13:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it past your bedtimes?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.91,0:13:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.82,0:13:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd you find us?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.09,0:13:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,A little birdie told me it saw\Nyou three climbing up the walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.11,0:13:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, we're on to you, Pegsy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.97,0:13:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.88,0:13:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been spying on\NKybus cards from up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.07,0:13:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The jig is up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.39,0:13:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you just admit it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.21,0:13:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.12,0:13:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You break into my private sanctuary through\Nthe window and accuse me of wrongdoing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.71,0:13:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Absolutely no one is allowed in this room,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.97,0:13:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'm afraid you three\Nhave seen too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.89,0:13:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.07,0:13:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have stayed in your rooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.05,0:14:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead, you will now be disciplined.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.09,0:14:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on? The floor! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.07,0:14:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.07,0:14:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Of shadows in this twilight hour,\Nexcept these souls who are these clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.91,0:14:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,what do you think they're up to i\Ndon't know but they're creeping me
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.09,0:14:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,out twilight hour except\Nthese souls and grant us
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.09,0:15:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,power begin there's
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.05,0:15:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,a blue eyes on that tablet i don't like\Nthis let's get out of here Oh, look there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.77,0:15:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's that painting again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.81,0:15:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Who can she be?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.13,0:15:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, those two look like they're dually.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.89,0:15:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.21,0:15:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.31,0:15:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.13,0:15:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.45,0:15:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.23,0:15:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Unlock the secret of\Nthe Millennium Puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.25,0:15:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Only then can you defeat Pegasus. Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.43,0:15:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.34,0:15:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The Millennium Puzzle, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.91,0:15:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.51,0:16:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It was all just a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.21,0:16:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Or was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.21,0:16:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did that rogue guy go?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.73,0:16:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.51,0:16:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Shadow Realm?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.71,0:16:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Not again!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.19,0:16:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,This is how the Shadow Games were\Nplayed thousands of years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.71,0:16:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,These duel rituals release\Nthe magic of the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.69,0:16:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And every soul I trap there increases\Nthe power of my Millennium Eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.49,0:16:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't imagine the\Nstrength of my magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.05,0:16:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But one power still eludes me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.01,0:16:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The ability to control life over death.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.01,0:16:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,For that magic, I must\Ncapture more souls like yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.95,0:16:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, he's gonna send us\Nall to the Shadow Realm!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.29,0:16:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.20,0:16:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.59,0:16:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't simply allow you\Nto escape after you've
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.01,0:16:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,snooped around my castle\Nand learned my secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.47,0:16:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope the accommodations in the\NShadow Realm are to your liking.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.05,0:16:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And my dear Bakura, your capture will do\Nmore than strengthen my shadow powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.11,0:16:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,For I shall also gain control\Nof your Millennium Ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.99,0:16:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.09,0:17:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.71,0:17:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Change of plans. Can this be?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.63,0:17:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I sense a dark soul within your ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.69,0:17:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You may indeed sense me now, but you\Nwon't remember any of this later.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.65,0:17:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Erase their mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.59,0:17:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.61,0:17:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.85,0:17:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What a horrible nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.07,0:17:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But was it a dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.81,0:17:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems so, so real.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.37,0:17:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel, I feel like something\Nterrible's going to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.77,0:17:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You cannot hide from me, Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.69,0:17:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Millennium Eye will soon be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.13,0:18:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You snooze, you lose
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.43,0:18:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let go of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.11,0:18:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my pizza.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.51,0:18:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep dreaming, Dweeb.\NIt's game over for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.59,0:18:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I've done it. This\Nstrategy is perfect. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.83,0:18:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Yugi, but your\Nnext duel's your last.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.57,0:18:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That wasn't any ordinary dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.13,0:18:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I know Grandpa was trying to send\Nme a message from the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.31,0:18:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But what is the secret\Nto my Millennium puzzle?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.77,0:18:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,How do I control it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.13,0:18:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I still don't know, and\NI'm running out of time.
